<title>UK: TABLE-Littlewoods proforma profit drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Littlewoods proforma profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to April 30 1997</p>
<p>(proforma) (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax		     85.2		   vs 90.7</p>
<p> Trading profit	   105.1		  vs 78.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,284		  vs 2,261</p>
<p>	 Full company name - The Littlewoods Organisation Plc.</p>
<p>Note - The figures are stated on a proforma basis as Littlewoods has changed its year end.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom + 44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
